REGEDIT4

; WSL in Arctic (docs/updates.md, docs/linux-gate.md): System32\bash.exe and
; wsl.exe run commands in the WSL distributions, as on Windows 10, behind the
; gate of the Linux subsystem. Agents work as on Windows: Claude Code finds
; Git Bash through Git for Windows itself, and its PowerShell tool takes
; C:\Program Files\PowerShell\7\pwsh.exe first. The variable that pointed its
; Bash tool into Linux goes away on systems that had it.
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\System\CurrentControlSet\Control\Session Manager\Environment]
"CLAUDE_CODE_GIT_BASH_PATH"=-
